        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"She alone and you not surprised",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"'Cause she ain't fit for no other man",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"So you approach as a gentleman",
          "rhyme":"an",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"\"Hello, ma'am, today you lookin' pretty damn elegant\"",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"I think she get the message like a telegram",
          "rhyme":"am",
