          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"18",
          "text":"'Cause your friends say you whipped",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"19",
          "text":"Every late night, you gotta go and dip",
